# System Architecture Diagram

---

## Purpose

This diagram illustrates the high-level architecture of AI Creative Studio.

---

## Layers

### User Layer

End users interact with the application through a modern React-based frontend.

---

### Presentation Layer

React

TypeScript

Tailwind CSS

Vite

---

### API Layer

Handles communication between frontend and AI services.

---

### AI Layer

IBM Granite processes prompts and generates intelligent responses.

---

### Backend Layer

Future backend services include authentication, project storage, and user management.

---

### Output Layer

Generated AI content is presented in the dashboard.

---

## Benefits

- Modular architecture
- Scalable design
- Enterprise-ready
- Easy maintenance

---

## Future Enhancements

- Docker
- Kubernetes
- IBM Cloud
- CI/CD
- Monitoring